			"notes": "### v1.4 - The QoL update -  _but for real this time_\n-------\n**New Text Renderer floating text**\n- Text is now rendered with graphical rendering methods \n    - More efficient and stable\n    - Text is destroyed when the client leaves, preferable over having armor stands hang out between log-in instances\n\n**Added Keybind Support**\n- Added the functionality for opening the GUI and toggling the debug view using keybinds. Defaults:\n    - GUI: I\n    - Debug View: N\n\nExtras\n- Fixed the new text renderer not refreshing its info when changes were made\n- Selection tool now makes the default area height 3 higher than the selection area"
		},
